title: tps-microstructure-surrogate
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shigaonkar
    given-names: Aryav
  - name: Collaborator Name TBD
abstract: >
  A reduced-order, microscale materials-modeling pipeline that generates
  synthetic FiberForm-like porous carbon-fiber microstructures, solves a
  simplified diffusion-reaction oxidation baseline and an effective-conductivity
  baseline, and trains a tabular physics-guided machine-learning surrogate.
  This is an educational research prototype validated against its own numerical
  baseline, not against experiment and not a flight-certification tool.
keywords:
  - thermal protection system
  - porous carbon fiber
  - oxidation
  - effective thermal conductivity
  - surrogate modeling
license: MIT
